格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Universal AI Agent Development Skills Hub & Cordis Plugin for Govard, Magento 2, Laravel. Works with Claude Code, Codex CLI, OpenCode, GitHub Copilot, DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1249032231","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"maestro-skills","slug":"ddtcorex/maestro-skills","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agent","ai-skills","claude-code","codex-cli","codex-plugin","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","govard","laravel","magento2"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Universal AI Agent Development Skills Hub & Cordis Plugin for Govard, Magento 2, Laravel. Works with"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Claude Code, Codex CLI, OpenCode, GitHub Copilot, DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Maestro Skills (`maestro-skills`)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A unified skills library for AI coding agents, packaged as a universal plugin for **DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" (DSH)**, **Claude Code**, **Codex CLI**, **OpenCode**, and **GitHub Copilot** — two halves in one b"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"**, **Claude Code**, **Codex CLI**, **OpenCode**, and **GitHub Copilot** — two halves in one bundle:"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- **Domain skills** — **Govard** development-environment orchestration and its supported web framewo"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rks (**Magento 2**, Laravel, Symfony, WordPress, generic PHP): architecture, linting, performance au"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"diting, security scanning, code review, Hyvä/Luma frontend, backend APIs, plus `php-dev-core` and `d"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"iagram-studio`.\n- **Process skills** — the complete **superpowers** methodology forked verbatim from"},{"id":"p4s5","text":" v7.0.0 (MIT, © Jesse Vincent): brainstorming, test-driven development, systematic debugging, writin"},{"id":"p4s6","text":"g/executing plans, subagent-driven development, code-review collaboration, session diagnosis, and mo"},{"id":"p4s7","text":"re. See `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` for license and sync policy."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Every skill follows the open Agent Skills standard (a `SKILL.md` file with `name`/`description` fron"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"tmatter), which all major AI Agent tools understand."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Works best with Govard.** Most command examples in the domain skills assume a Govard-managed dev"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" environment (`govard sh -c \"...\"`, `govard tool magerun ...`) — without it, you'll need to adapt th"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"em to your own container/CLI setup. One-line install: `curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ddtcorex/govard/master/install.sh | bash`."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 📂 Directory Structure"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Every skill lives under `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — this is the single source of truth across all sup"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ported AI tools and platforms:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🤖 Skill Compatibility Matrix"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Every skill works identically on every listed tool."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Group | Skills | Claude Code | Codex CLI | OpenCode | GitHub Copilot | DeepSeek Harness |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Process (superpowers fork) | brainstorming, diagnosing-superpowers, dispatching-parallel-agents, e"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"xecuting-plans, finishing-a-development-branch, receiving-code-review, requesting-code-review, subag"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ent-driven-development, systematic-debugging, test-driven-development, using-git-worktrees, using-su"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"perpowers, verification-before-completion, writing-plans, writing-skills | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Cor"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"e & Standards | magento2-dev-core | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Linting & Auditing | magento2-linter, mage"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"nto2-performance-audit, magento2-security-scan, magento2-code-review | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Framewo"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"rks | magento2-hyva-dev, magento2-frontend-dev, magento2-backend-dev, maestro-design | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅"},{"id":"p13s8","text":" | ✅ |\n| Toolchains (Govard) | govard-toolbox, govard-magento, govard-laravel, govard-symfony, govar"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"d-wordpress, review-in-worktree | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| PHP Foundation | php-dev-core | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | "},{"id":"p13s10","text":"✅ | ✅ |\n| Diagrams | diagram-studio | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 💾 Installation"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 1. DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — as a plugin (recommended)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"One command is a complete install — the plugin serves every packaged skill itself:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web`. No install.sh needed."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**The agent preset is a separate, explicit step.** Skills and presets are two different\nmechanisms: "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"the plugin registers a skill provider, but a preset is an\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset` **declarat"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ion row** that some bundle has to carry. To get\n**\"Maestro Skills\"** in the Web GUI agent picker, co"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"py the two files from this package's\n`.dsh-plugin/` into a `dsh-agent-preset` row in the profile's `"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"rom this package's\n`.dsh-plugin/` into a `dsh-agent-preset` row in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> This plugin used to copy that directory into `~/.dsh/.agent-presets/maestro-skills/` on\n> every bo"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ot and log that the preset was installed. DSH stopped reading that directory when\n> presets became d"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"eclaration rows (2026-09-22) — the write changed nothing and the log\n> misled. The template still sh"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ips in `.dsh-plugin/` because declaration rows are copied\n> from it by hand."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Codex + Claude delegation preset (optional bundles, optional preset):** when the web\nprofile also "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"installs the two optional subagent bundles (`@deepseek-ai/dsh-subagent-codex`\nand `@deepseek-ai/dsh-"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"subagent-claude-code`), add a second declaration row for\n**\"Maestro Skills + Subagents (Codex + Clau"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"de)\"** — the same composition with\n`subagent_codex` and `subagent_claude_code` tool rows enabled, so"},{"id":"p22s5","text":" the model can delegate to\nthose products through their official app-server/SDK result contract inst"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"ead of whichever\nCLI happens to be on `PATH`. `src/subagent-variant.ts` is the executable definition"},{"id":"p22s7","text":" of that\nderivation. Both providers authenticate via their native subscription login, so\nquota-limit"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"ed accounts may see provider-side quota errors until the limit resets."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The package builds itself on install via its `prepare` script. pnpm ≥ 10 blocks git-dependency build"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" scripts until you allow them — if the first add reports an ignored build, copy the key pnpm prints "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"into the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml` and re-run:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 2. Claude Code — as a plugin"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Updates: `/plugin marketplace update ddtcorex`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### 3. Codex CLI — as a plugin"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Updates: `codex plugin marketplace upgrade ddtcorex`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 4. OpenCode & GitHub Copilot — loose skill files (no plugin loader there)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Tool | Scans (project scope) | Scans (personal scope) |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| OpenCode | `.opencode/skills/` | `~/.config/opencode/skills/` |\n| GitHub Copilot | `.github/skills"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"/` | `~/.copilot/skills/` |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"> The installer only serves tools without a plugin loader. On Claude Code,\n> Codex CLI and DSH, inst"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"all the plugin (sections 1-3 above) instead of\n> linking loose files: a loose copy shadows the plugi"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"n with a stale cache.\n> Upgrading from an install that used the removed `claude`, `codex` or `dsh`\n>"},{"id":"p36s4","text":" targets: run `install.sh --uninstall` once (it removes every path the\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
